msgstr "يترك مكافأة."

#: script/events/room.js:629
msgid "some weird metal he picked up on his travels."
msgstr "بعض المعدن الغريب الذي التقطه في رحلاته."

#: script/events/room.js:645
msgid "some weird glowing boxes he picked up on his travels."
msgstr "بعض الصناديق المتوهجة الغريبة التي التقطها في رحلاته."

#: script/events/room.js:661
msgid "all he has are some scales."
msgstr "كل ما لديه بعض الحراشف."

#: script/events/room.js:675
msgid "the man expresses his thanks and hobbles off."
msgstr "الرجل يعبر عن شكره ويعرج بعيداً."

#: script/events/setpieces.js:6
msgid "An Outpost"
msgstr "مخفر بعيد"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:10 script/events/setpieces.js:12
msgid "a safe place in the wilds."
msgstr "مكان آمن في البرية."

#: script/events/setpieces.js:35
msgid "A Murky Swamp"
msgstr "مستنقع كدر"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:39
msgid "rotting reeds rise out of the swampy earth."
msgstr "قصب متعفن يرتفع من الأرض المستنقعية."

#: script/events/setpieces.js:40
msgid "a lone frog sits in the muck, silently."
msgstr "ضفدع وحيد يجلس في الوحل، بصمت."

#: script/events/setpieces.js:42
msgid "a swamp festers in the stagnant air."
msgstr "مستنقع يتعفن في الهواء الراكد."

#: script/events/setpieces.js:45 script/events/setpieces.js:552
#: script/events/setpieces.js:609 script/events/setpieces.js:891
#: script/events/setpieces.js:1317 script/events/setpieces.js:1335
#: script/events/setpieces.js:3547
msgid "enter"
msgstr "دخول"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:56
msgid "deep in the swamp is a moss-covered cabin."
msgstr "في عمق المستنقع يوجد كوخ مغطى بالطحالب."

#: script/events/setpieces.js:57
msgid "an old wanderer sits inside, in a seeming trance."
msgstr "متجول عجوز يجلس في الداخل، في حالة تشبه الغيبوبة."

#: script/events/setpieces.js:62
msgid "talk"
msgstr "حديث"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:73
msgid "the wanderer takes the charm and nods slowly."
msgstr "المتجول يأخذ التعويذة ويومئ ببطء."

#: script/events/setpieces.js:74
msgid "he speaks of once leading the great fleets to fresh worlds."
msgstr "يتحدث عن قيادته ذات مرة للأساطيل العظيمة إلى عوالم جديدة."

#: script/events/setpieces.js:75
msgid "unfathomable destruction to fuel wanderer hungers."
msgstr "دمار لا يمكن فهمه لإشباع جوع المتجولين."

#: script/events/setpieces.js:76
msgid "his time here, now, is his penance."
msgstr "وقته هنا، الآن، هو تكفيره."

#: script/events/setpieces.js:93
msgid "A Damp Cave"
msgstr "كهف رطب"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:97
msgid "the mouth of the cave is wide and dark."
msgstr "مدخل الكهف واسع ومظلم."

#: script/events/setpieces.js:98
msgid "can't see what's inside."
msgstr "لا يمكن رؤية ما في الداخل."

#: script/events/setpieces.js:100
msgid "the earth here is split, as if bearing an ancient wound"
msgstr "الأرض هنا مشقوقة، كما لو كانت تحمل جرحاً قديماً"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:103 script/events/setpieces.js:2949
#: script/events/setpieces.js:3469
msgid "go inside"
msgstr "الذهاب للداخل"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:122 script/events/setpieces.js:267
msgid "a startled beast defends its home"
msgstr "وحش مذعور يدافع عن بيته"

#: script/events/setpieces.js:137 script/events/setpieces.js:188
#: script/events/setpieces.js:230 script/events/setpieces.js:249
#: script/events/setpieces.js:282 script/events/setpieces.js:316
